mujoco_wasm (the coefficient page, physics/)
https://github.com/zalo/mujoco_wasm
License: MIT
Copyright (c) 2017 Konstantin Gredeskoul (as stated in that repository's LICENSE,
copied to physics/LICENSE-mujoco_wasm)

physics/src/ is that repository's viewer (main.js, mujocoUtils.js, utils/) with
the panel translated and trimmed, plus experiments.js, written for this site.
Taken from commit f6b202ca29bc1706e4db583edf732c4a0902c27b. The four exp_*.xml
scenes are written for this site. mug.xml, mug.obj, mug.png, hammock.xml and
humanoid.xml are the copies shipped in that repository; hammock.xml and
humanoid.xml carry DeepMind's Apache-2.0 header.
hammock.xml drops the flex contact attribute internal="false", which the
MuJoCo 3.17 wasm build no longer accepts; nothing else in it is changed.

The libraries the page loads are fetched from the npm registry at build time:

- three 0.181.2, MIT (dist/physics/lib/three/LICENSE)
- @mujoco/mujoco 3.17.0, Apache-2.0 (dist/physics/lib/mujoco/NOTICE; the
  package ships no LICENSE file, its package.json states Apache-2.0)

